window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A world divided—a goddess united.</b></p> <p>After Eunae's tumultuous ascension results in her being crowned queen, Goryeo joins the Jiaguo Empire, splitting the continent in two. Yoshika barely has time to adjust to Eunae joining as another aspect before the sleeping giant of Qin makes their move. Meanwhile, with war looming, Yue must confront her own feelings as she searches for a way to unite the rival empires. Can Yoshika rise to the challenge as a nascent goddess of unity—or will the God-Emperor of Qin prove too much for even her? One way or another, she won't have to face it alone.</p> <p>Join Yoshika one last time in the epic conclusion to their long and harrowing journey of friendship, love, self-discovery, and magical martial arts.</p>"; 
